  "exact_results": [
    "Arbitrary finite n actual smooth cutoff stages in Fin3 Grushin space, with coefficient c(k)>=0 supplied stagewise.",
    "Regions and cutoffs depend only on center, widths, gap and stage count, never on solution or PDE.",
    "Named gap min(aY-bY,aT-bT)/(2(n+1)) is positive and leaves a two-gap margin after n stages.",
    "Terminal open region contains requested closed inner box; all regions open, measurable, nested and contained in outer open box.",
    "Explicit unchanged M=1,D=1 and prior h12 scalar/gradient constants with S=norm(centerY)+2aY."
